        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Want to know how to measure the effectiveness and productivity of white label services?",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\nYou may already know about ",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "white label services",
          "bold": true
        },
        " if you’re running a digital agency or working with clients needing websites or online stores. But hiring and using them is not enough—you also need to know if they’re actually working for your business."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "White label services",
          "bold": true
        },
        " mean that another agency does work for you in the background, and you deliver the final work to your client under your brand name. For example, a ",
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "white label Shopify agency",
          "bold": true
        },
        " creates websites for you. However, your end client believes your developers and designers built them—the exact process for ",
        {
          "type": "link",
          "href": "/white-label-wordpress-development-services",
          "text": "white label WordPress development"
        },
        ", ",
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "web design",
          "bold": true
        },
        ", and other services."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "children": [
        "Many companies use white label services to save time, cut costs, and get more clients. But the point is, how do you know if these white label service providers are truly working and effective for your business? Let’s break down the ",
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "key steps for measuring the success of white label services",
          "bold": true
        },
        ", whether you’re working with ",
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "white label WordPress developers",
          "bold": true
        },
        ", a ",
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Shopify white label agency",
          "bold": true
        },
        ", or a ",
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "white label website design company",
          "bold": true
        },
        "."
      ]
    }
  ],
